[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえベップ。ヤンネさん、ホントにここにいるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey Bepp, are you sure Janne's here?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。今日はこのカフェの警備担当だから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. She's on security detail at this cafe today."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "カフェなのに警備？\u3000なんだか物騒ね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Security? At a cafe? That seems a bit intense."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここは飲食だけじゃなく、\n冒険者への依頼の斡旋もやっているからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This place doesn't just serve food - they also handle requests for adventurers."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、イェルカ。さすが冒険者、詳しいね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Being an adventurer, of course you'd know all all about that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "島の外の奴らもやってきたりするから、\nいざこざが起きないよう聖戦士が目を光らせてるのさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "People not from the island come here too, so Sacred Knights are needed to keep the peace."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へえ……王都のカフェに似てるなあ――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh... reminds me of the Star's Cocoon in the capital-"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いらっしゃいませー！\u3000あ、みんな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Welcome! Oh hey, everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ってライザ先輩！？\u3000あ、あれ？\nここって「星の繭」じゃないですよね……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza?! Wait, but this isn't the Star's Cocoon...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは、実はこっちでも働くことにしたんだ。\n情報も色々集められるしね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Haha, yeah! I picked up a job working here too. It's a great place to gather information."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あと、あたし以外にもう一人……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And  there's also..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いらっしゃいませ、皆さん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Welcome, everyone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "トトリ！\u3000あんたもここで働いてるのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori! You're working here too?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお……質素なカフェが一気に華やかに！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wow... this humble cafe just got a lot more lively!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、賑やかだと思ったら。みんなでお食事？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, what's all this commotion? Is everyone here for a meal?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ヤンネさん！\nって、今厨房から出てきませんでした！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey Janne! Wait, did you just come out of the kitchen?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。注文が立て込んでいたから、少しお手伝いをね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. They were getting busy, so I lent them a hand."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "警備のお仕事なのでは……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But what about security...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あからさまにそういう空気を出すと、お客さんが\n居づらくなってしまうでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we make it too overt, it scares away the customers."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "厨房から横目で見るくらいがちょうどいいのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Keeping an eye on things from the kitchen works just fine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど、そういうもんですか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, that makes sense!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、ヤンネさんの手料理が食べられるのは\n結構アリだな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though I have to say, getting to try your cooking doesn't sound half bad..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "良かったら、何か食べていく？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would you like to order something?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さんせーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Count me in!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]